Added AutomationStepRepo.InsertTx/DeleteByAutomationTx and AutomationStepChildRepo.UpsertTx so aggregate writes can share one pgx.Tx.
Create, update, and import now convert accepted typed DTO steps to ordered CTI model payloads and call aggregate persistence before audit/reload side effects.
Added rollback/atomic handler test that forces a child-step persistence error and asserts no parent or prior steps commit.
Ran gofmt on allowed Go files.
